    "detailed_description": "<strong></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A brutal challenge of precision, patience, and relentless frustration awaits you.</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you endure the punishing physics and master the art of failure? Your goal is simple: <strong>drag the ball to the pipe</strong>. But the path? Unforgiving. Every slope, every trap, every pixel counts.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no checkpoints. Just you, precise control, and your will to keep going.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Game Over, Please, you will face 95 handcrafted levels designed to break your mind and rebuild your reflexes.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With clean controls and brutal consequences, the challenging physics based on contact and timing will be your worst enemy and best ally.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 achievements await the few who survive the journey, through a crescendo of rage and triumph, designed for those who enjoy games that climb, fall, and make you scream.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've ever fallen for a game where <strong>one slip sends you back to the start</strong>, this experience will feel painfully familiar.</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>95 handcrafted levels:</strong> A maze of constantly evolving obstacles and traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple yet challenging mechanics:</strong> Master the art of guiding the ball with precise mouse control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guaranteed frustration:</strong> Prepare to lose your mind, repeatedly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immeasurable satisfaction:</strong> The final reward for the most perseverant.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A brutal challenge of precision, patience, and relentless frustration awaits you.</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you endure the punishing physics and master the art of failure? Your goal is simple: <strong>drag the ball to the pipe</strong>. But the path? Unforgiving. Every slope, every trap, every pixel counts.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no checkpoints. Just you, precise control, and your will to keep going.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Game Over, Please, you will face 95 handcrafted levels designed to break your mind and rebuild your reflexes.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With clean controls and brutal consequences, the challenging physics based on contact and timing will be your worst enemy and best ally.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 achievements await the few who survive the journey, through a crescendo of rage and triumph, designed for those who enjoy games that climb, fall, and make you scream.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've ever fallen for a game where <strong>one slip sends you back to the start</strong>, this experience will feel painfully familiar.</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>95 handcrafted levels:</strong> A maze of constantly evolving obstacles and traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple yet challenging mechanics:</strong> Master the art of guiding the ball with precise mouse control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guaranteed frustration:</strong> Prepare to lose your mind, repeatedly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immeasurable satisfaction:</strong> The final reward for the most perseverant.</p></li></ul>",
